(a) THE CORE ATLAS: S(P) for all 495 eight-speed cores P in {1,...,12}
==============================================================================
  min |S(P)| over all cores : 31807/194040 = 0.163920   at P = (1, 2, 3, 5, 7, 8, 9, 11)
     (the constant quoted in THM-1162 as '0.164 <= |S(P)|')
  max |S(P)|                : 61/168 = 0.363095
  component count N(P)      : min 14 (at (1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 11, 12)), max 26 (at (2, 3, 4, 6, 8, 9, 10, 12))
  LONGEST component         : min over cores 1/70 = 0.014286 at (1, 2, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11)
                              max over cores 29/420 = 0.069048
  -> if the longest component is <= w, E_w(P) is EMPTY: hard obstruction at
     w >= 1/70, i.e. k1 <= 6/(7w) = 60.00

